# The build context of the images built from the repository root
# (`deploy/functions/Dockerfile`, story 20.2; `deploy/web/Dockerfile`, story
# 20.3). Each Dockerfile COPYs only what it names; this keeps local secrets and
# bulk out of the context entirely.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars
_bmad
_bmad-output
.claude
# Story 20.3: the web build's hidden source maps (the whole original source,
# comments included) never reach an image; deploy/web/Dockerfile also fails
# if one is left.
apps/web/dist/**/*.map
